[253.216472, "o", "        \"leakage_risk_summary\": \"The starter model was severely contaminated by temporal leakage. Specifically: (1) f02, f03, and f08 included event/ticket activity and vitality scores from on or after the period open date; (2) f04, f06, and f07 used post-open case resolutions and billing/invoice information; (3) f09 and f10 used future subscriber ledger balances. All prohibited/unavailable features were entirely removed from both the feature matrix and project source. Repaired features were corrected by strictly enforcing that all queried records, settlement dates, and due dates with grace periods occurred strictly before period open.\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
